<!--
  Checked against the pages that actually exist, by scripts/check-quality.mjs.
  The per-vendor pages are generated (scripts/make_vendor_pages.py) and the
  vendor set is a decision governed by docs/03, so adding one without listing it
  here fails the build rather than quietly shipping a sitemap with a hole in it.

  No <lastmod>. Every page is regenerated on each weekly run whether or not its
  content moved, so a timestamp taken from the file would announce a change that
  did not happen — and "state only what was measured" is the rule this project
  is built on. Publication dates that mean something live in the data, where
  they are derived from `runs.trigger`.
-->
